OL,3,AMet chief warns policing 'heading for
OL,4,Afailure' without reform
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of the Metropolitan Police is
OL,7,Fto warn that policing in England and
OL,8,FWales is "heading for failure" without
OL,9,Furgent reform.
OL,11,FIn a speech on Friday, Sir Mark Rowley
OL,12,Fwill call for the system to change,
OL,13,Farguing it is unable to cope with the
OL,14,Fsophistication of modern criminals.
OL,16,FHe is proposing eight to 10 regional
OL,17,Fpolice forces, supported by hundreds of
OL,18,Flocal policing commands and a new
OL,19,FNational Police Service, in what would
OL,20,Fbe the biggest overhaul since the
OL,21,F1960s.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
