OL,3,ADemocratic socialist defeats incumbent
OL,4,AKaren Bass in Los Angeles mayor's race
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemocratic socialist Nithya Raman has
OL,7,Ftoppled incumbent Karen Bass in the
OL,8,Frace for mayor of Los Angeles.
OL,10,FRaman's win stunned political watchers
OL,11,Fin California after she entered the
OL,12,Frace as a long-shot candidate against
OL,13,FBass, a political heavyweight who
OL,14,Fpreviously served in Congress and had
OL,15,Fnever lost a race for political office.
OL,17,FRaman has frequently been compared to
OL,18,FNew York City Mayor Zohran Mamdani.
OL,19,FBoth are democratic socialists and ran
OL,20,Fon progressive platforms.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
