OL,3,AHoax bomb threats target European
OL,4,Aairlines and airports for second time
OL,5,Ain a week
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 21 aircraft and several
OL,8,Fairports across Europe have been
OL,9,Ftargeted by bomb threats in the second
OL,10,Fsuch incident this week, with the UK
OL,11,Fcalling it a "malicious hoax".
OL,13,FFlights to Austria, Belgium, Bulgaria,
OL,14,Fthe Czech Republic, France, Italy,
OL,15,FPoland and Romania were affected. An
OL,16,FAer Lingus plane from Dublin to Rome
OL,17,Fwas diverted to an air base in France
OL,18,Fand Italian fighter jets escorted
OL,19,FFinnair's Helsinki-Rome flight.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
