OL,3,AHoax bomb threats target European
OL,4,Aairlines and airports for second time
OL,5,Ain a week
OL,6,
OL,7,FEasyJet said its flights from Newcastle
OL,8,Fand Glasgow were met by police in
OL,9,FPrague as a precaution. London Heathrow
OL,10,Fand Birmingham airports received
OL,11,Fthreats that were assessed as not
OL,12,Fcredible.
OL,14,FNo explosives have been found during
OL,15,Fsearches, and it is not clear if the
OL,16,Fincidents, some claimed by a little
OL,17,Fknown group, are related.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
